    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「Kernel PCA」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "伯恩哈德·舍尔科普夫、亚历山大·斯莫拉和克劳斯-罗伯特·穆勒证明 PCA 可以通过隐式特征空间中的特征值问题进行核化。Kernel PCA 使非线性结构可以通过成对相似性来处理。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-component-analysis-as-a-kernel-eigenvalue-problem"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "核矩阵替代显式坐标，使 PCA 能找到非线性主成分。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-component-analysis-as-a-kernel-eigenvalue-problem"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 Kernel PCA 视为经典 PCA 与核方法之间的清晰桥梁。它的长期影响在于展示了在深度嵌入普及前，非线性表示学习可以通过相似性矩阵表达。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-nonlinear-component-analysis-as-a-kernel-eigenvalue-problem"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「Kernel PCA」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
